<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>登入 - cxhkgcxvhhh Aviation enthusiast Club 圖庫</title>
    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial, "Microsoft JhengHei", sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a 0%, #1e3a5f 50%, #3b82f6 100%);
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        body::before {
            content: "✈️";
            position: absolute;
            font-size: 300px;
            opacity: 0.03;
            top: 50%;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        .login-card {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
            backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
            border-radius: 24px;
            padding: 50px 40px;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 420px;
            box-shadow: 0 25px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 3rem;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .site-name {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #0f172a;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
            letter-spacing: -0.3px;
        }

        .site-subtitle {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: #64748b;
            margin-bottom: 35px;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .google-btn {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 12px;
            width: 100%;
            background: white;
            border: 1.5px solid #e2e8f0;
            padding: 14px 20px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: #0f172a;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
            cursor: pointer;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
        }

        .google-btn:hover {
            border-color: #3b82f6;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.15);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        .google-btn:active {
            transform: scale(0.98);
        }

        .google-btn img {
            width: 22px;
            height: 22px;
        }

        .divider {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            margin: 25px 0;
            color: #94a3b8;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .divider::before,
        .divider::after {
            content: "";
            flex: 1;
            height: 1px;
            background: #e2e8f0;
        }

        .divider span {
            padding: 0 15px;
        }

        .back-link {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
            color: #64748b;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: color 0.2s;
        }

        .back-link:hover {
            color: #3b82f6;
        }

        .features {
            margin-top: 30px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 25px;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            color: #94a3b8;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .features span {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 5px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            .login-card {
                margin: 20px;
                padding: 40px 25px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="login-card">
        <div class="logo">✈️</div>
        <div class="site-name">cxhkgcxvhhh Aviation enthusiast Club 圖庫</div>
        <div class="site-subtitle">登入以分享你嘅航空攝影作品</div>

        <a href="/auth/google" class="google-btn">
            <img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/53/Google_%22G%22_Logo.svg" alt="Google">
            使用 Google 帳戶登入
        </a>

        <div class="divider">
            <span>或</span>
        </div>

        <a href="/" class="back-link">← 返回首頁瀏覽</a>

        <div class="features">
            <span>📤 上載照片</span>
            <span>💬 評論互動</span>
            <span>⭐ 積分系統</span>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>